---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Gallery
permalink: /gallery/
description: "Photographs of Carolyn and Merrick from their engagement session on the coast."
---
{#- The hero uses the ring photo, not a portrait: this band is short and the title
    stack sits dead centre, so any centred face either got cropped by the band or
    read behind the lettering. A detail shot has nothing to collide with, and the
    couple's faces are the first thing you meet in the grid below. Warm photo, so it
    takes the wine scrim (--scene-warm), never the bluebell dusk. -#}
<section class="section section--scene section--scene-warm" style="--scene:var(--scene-rings)">
  <div class="wrap center stack">
    <span class="label eyebrow">Carolyn &amp; Merrick</span>
    <h1>Gallery</h1>
    <p class="lead">A few of our favorite moments.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="gallery">
      {% for p in site.gallery %}
      <a href="{{ p.src }}" aria-label="{{ p.alt }}"><img
        src="{{ p.src | replace('.jpg', '-800.jpg') }}"
        srcset="{{ p.src | replace('.jpg', '-400.jpg') }} 400w, {{ p.src | replace('.jpg', '-800.jpg') }} 800w, {{ p.src }} {{ p.w }}w"
        sizes="(max-width:355px) 92vw, (max-width:560px) 45vw, 260px"
        width="{{ p.w }}" height="{{ p.h }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" loading="lazy"></a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
